15. Complete Project Planning
15.1 Planning Principle
The team should use this SRS as the requirements baseline and derive downstream engineering artifacts from it. The recommended sequence is requirements → PRD/SRS baseline → DFD → use cases → ERD/database → architecture → UI wireframes → API contracts → implementation → testing → deployment → demonstration.
15.2 Phase Plan
Phase	Work	Main output	Dependency
Phase 1	Requirements freeze	PRD + SRS + business rules	Project concept
Phase 2	Process modelling	Context DFD, Level 1, Level 2 DFDs	SRS
Phase 3	Use-case modelling	Use case diagram + detailed use cases	SRS
Phase 4	Data modelling	ER diagram + normalized relational schema	SRS + use cases
Phase 5	Architecture	System architecture + module boundaries	SRS + ERD
Phase 6	UI planning	Wireframes/screens + navigation flow	Use cases
Phase 7	API design	Endpoint list + schemas + error model	SRS + ERD
Phase 8	Backend implementation	FastAPI modules + DB + auth	Architecture + API
Phase 9	Frontend implementation	React pages/components	UI + API
Phase 10	Integration	End-to-end workflows	Frontend + backend
Phase 11	Testing	Test cases, bug log, regression	Integrated system
Phase 12	Deployment	Dockerized deployment	Stable build
Phase 13	Documentation/demo	Final report, PPT, demo script	Completed system
