16. Verification and Validation Plan
16.1 Test Levels
•	Unit tests for validation, services and business rules.
•	Integration tests for API/database interactions.
•	System tests for complete marketplace workflows.
•	Security tests for authentication and authorization.
•	Usability checks for critical user journeys.
•	Regression testing after changes.
16.2 Critical Test Matrix
Test ID	Scenario	Expected result
T-01	Valid farmer registration	Account created with Farmer role.
T-02	Valid buyer registration	Account created with Buyer role.
T-03	Invalid registration	Validation error; no invalid account.
T-04	Unverified listing creation	Denied.
T-05	Unverified chat initiation	Denied.
T-06	Verification rejection without reason	Rejected action requires reason.
T-07	Verification resubmission	New/updated attempt recorded.
T-08	Valid listing creation	Active listing stored.
T-09	Valid requirement creation	Active requirement stored.
T-10	Search/filter	Only matching permitted records returned.
T-11	Offer acceptance	Order automatically created from final terms.
T-12	Inventory over-allocation	Backend prevents invalid allocation.
T-13	Farmer rejects inventory update	Inventory remains unchanged.
T-14	Lower quantity proposal	Buyer acceptance required.
T-15	Direct finalized-order edit	Blocked; amendment required.
T-16	Amendment accepted by both	Amendment effective; original preserved.
T-17	Payment record	Reference/status stored.
T-18	Delivery only one-party completion	Order remains incomplete.
T-19	Completed order rating	Eligible rating allowed.
T-20	Incomplete order rating	Rating blocked.
T-21	Expired listing purchase	Blocked.
T-22	Completed cancellation	Blocked.
T-23	Private chat access by unrelated user	Denied.
T-24	Admin verification/report action	Action and status recorded.
T-25	Analytics calculation	Historical descriptive values are correctly aggregated.
