Verification	UC-05 to UC-06	Verification DFD, Verification ERD	T-06 to T-07
Marketplace	UC-07 to UC-10	Marketplace DFD, Listing/Requirement ERD	T-08 to T-10
Communication/Negotiation	UC-11 to UC-12	Chat/Offer DFD, Message/Offer ERD	T-11, T-23
Orders/Inventory	UC-13 to UC-15	Order/Inventory DFD + ERD	T-12 to T-16
