Test Plan	Validation strategy and test cases	Defined baseline
Final Report/PPT	Academic/project presentation	To be prepared after implementation evidence
Appendix B — Important Locked Decisions
•	Separate Farmer and Buyer registration flows.
•	Hybrid registration with progressive profile completion.
•	Progressive, role/category-specific, document-based verification.
•	Admin rejection requires a reason and supports resubmission.
•	Multiple verification documents are supported.
•	Unverified users can browse/search but cannot create marketplace content, initiate chat, make offers or transact.
•	Only verified users can initiate contextual chat.
•	Chat supports text, images and user-controlled contact/document sharing.
•	Structured offers can originate from listing/requirement pages or chat.
•	Separate Find Produce and Find Buyers search experiences.
•	Accepted offers automatically create orders.
•	Inventory changes require farmer approval.
•	Finalized orders are immutable and changed through amendments.
•	Payment is tracked, not processed.
•	Delivery is basic coordination, not logistics tracking.
•	Ratings are tied to completed transactions.
•	Analytics are descriptive, not predictive.
